  id: "WI-029",
  description: "De Bruijn variable representation: DeBruijn(u32) for bound vars in stored terms, Global(VarId) for instantiated vars during resolution. Enables canonical hash-consing, per-query caching, and proper quantifier scoping. See Proposal 024. Prerequisite for WI-027 (forall in rule bodies).",
  acceptance: [ToolPasses("cargo-test")],
